  "description": "Non-material amendment to vary Condition 1 of planning permission ref. 2023/02105/RES granted on 24 September 2024 for: Reserved Matters Application relating to the approval of access, appearance, landscaping, layout and scale in respect of Phase 4 (comprising Development Plots D1, D2 and D3 (Buildings 7, 8 and 9)) for the erection of 3no. 18-28 storey buildings with basement level providing 503 residential units, commercial floorspace with associated external amenity space, public realm, car and cycle parking and other works pursuant to planning permission 2023/01965/VAR dated 21 August 2024 (for the comprehensive residential led mixed use redevelopment of the former M&S Warehouse in White City). The amendments relate to changes to: an increase of B7 Residential GEA by 326m2 (overall masterplan GEA is not changing); minor redistribution of residential and non-residential uses within Plot D1; new bay windows and recessed balconies introduced to level 20+ in B7 north tower; reduction of 1 x market homes; change in mix to the private units in B7; update to market sale Accessible Homes (M4(3)) strategy with improvements to the distribution within the building proposed; layout amendments to all levels other than affordable elements; and minor reduction in commercial floorspace within B7. ",
